(Time Tracker is an enterprise Progressive Web Application \(PWA\) designed to provide 100% verifiable workforce attendance tracking,) Tj
T* (automated Civil Service Form No. 48 Daily Time Records \(DTR\), and accurate payroll computations. It replaces legacy biometric) Tj
T* (hardware terminals and paper punch cards with a tamper-resistant mobile-first platform that functions seamlessly across iOS, Android,) Tj
T* (and Desktop workstations.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
45.354330708661422 527.8112598425195756 Td
(The platform resolves core enterprise challenges: buddy punching, time theft, proxy attendance, and manual payroll calculation errors.) Tj
T* (By uniting hardware-bound biometric authentication with server-side geofencing and immutable rate logs, management gains complete) Tj
T* (confidence that every recorded hour represents physical presence and authorized work.) Tj
